                                                "sense_id": "dcff4b29-943f-35f9-82d8-a262d37ebcf0",
                                                "text": "Even if rational people conclude that the death penalty is a deterrent, that it is not administered with unnecessary pain, that there are criminals who are not rehabilitable, that it is less expensive than prison, it still violates the Eighth Amendment?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c4fd9e0-2ab3-4602-abc7-113f23fa3b44",
                                                "sense_id": "dcff4b29-943f-35f9-82d8-a262d37ebcf0",
                                                "text": "The patient with the latter carries an obvious stigma as the one less likely to be fully rehabilitable for social usefulness."
                                            }
